{"unit_id": "tag:0083:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n下面这个看起来有些奇怪的引理很可能并非必需，但在处理代数结构（algebraic structures）预层（presheaves）的层化（sheafification）时很方便。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "algebraic structures", "target_term": "代数结构"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sheafification", "target_term": "层化"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "algebraic structures", "target_term": "代数结构", "context": "指预层所取值的结构"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层", "context": "指要层化的对象"}, {"source_term": "sheafification", "target_term": "层化", "context": "指对代数结构预层施行的构造"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0084:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为拓扑空间（topological space）。设<MATH_0002>为<MATH_0003>上的集合（sets）预层（presheaf）。设<MATH_0004>是开（open）的。\n存在如下典范（canonical）的纤维积（fibre product）图表（diagram）\n<MATH_0005>\n其中的映射（maps）如下：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 左侧竖直映射（map）的各分量（components）为\n<MATH_0006>\n其中的等式（equality）即引理<REF_0001>中的等式。\n<STRUCT_0003> 上方的水平（horizontal）映射（map）来自预层（presheaves）之间的映射（map）<MATH_0007>，该映射在第<REF_0002>节中给出。\n<STRUCT_0004> 右侧竖直映射（map）的各分量映射（maps）显然为<MATH_0008>。\n<STRUCT_0005> 下方的水平（horizontal）映射（map）的各分量（components）为\n<MATH_0009>\n它们来自预层（presheaves）之间的映射（map）\n<MATH_0010>，该映射在第<REF_0003>节中给出。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范"}, {"source_term": "fibre product", "target_term": "纤维积"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "components", "target_term": "分量"}, {"source_term": "equality", "target_term": "等式"}, {"source_term": "horizontal", "target_term": "水平"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "horizontal", "target_term": "水平"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "components", "target_term": "分量"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "指预层的底空间"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指预层的取值类型"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "指底空间上的集合值预层"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开", "context": "指所取子集的开性"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范", "context": "修饰由给定数据确定的图表"}, {"source_term": "fibre product", "target_term": "纤维积", "context": "指所断言的拉回性质"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表", "context": "指所显示的方形图表"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "统称图表中的箭头"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指图表左侧箭头"}, {"source_term": "components", "target_term": "分量", "context": "指左侧箭头的各坐标映射"}, {"source_term": "equality", "target_term": "等式", "context": "指左侧分量公式中的相等关系"}, {"source_term": "horizontal", "target_term": "水平", "context": "修饰图表上方的箭头"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指图表上方箭头"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层", "context": "指诱导上方箭头的映射所连接的对象"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指诱导上方箭头的预层间映射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指图表右侧箭头"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指右侧箭头的各分量映射"}, {"source_term": "horizontal", "target_term": "水平", "context": "修饰图表下方的箭头"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指图表下方箭头"}, {"source_term": "components", "target_term": "分量", "context": "指下方箭头的各坐标映射"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层", "context": "指诱导下方分量的映射所连接的对象"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指诱导下方分量的预层间映射"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0084:proof", "translation": "这个图表（diagram）显然交换（commutes）。我们须证明它是纤维积（fibre product）图表（diagram）。下方的水平（horizontal）箭头（arrow）是单射（injective），因为所有映射（maps）<MATH_0001>都是单射（injective）（见引理<REF_0001>证明的开头）。\n截面（section）<MATH_0002>属于<MATH_0003>，当且仅当<MATH_0004>成立。而<MATH_0005>表示，在每一点（point）的邻近，截面（section）<MATH_0006>来自<MATH_0007>的一个截面（section）。根据茎（stalk）函子（functors）的定义，这等价（equivalent）于说，<MATH_0008>在每个茎（stalk）<MATH_0009>中的值来自茎（stalk）<MATH_0010>的一个元素（element）。引理得证。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "fibre product", "target_term": "纤维积"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "horizontal", "target_term": "水平"}, {"source_term": "arrow", "target_term": "箭头"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射"}, {"source_term": "section", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "section", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "section", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "stalk", "target_term": "茎"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "stalk", "target_term": "茎"}, {"source_term": "stalk", "target_term": "茎"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表", "context": "指引理所述方形图表"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换", "context": "指沿方形图表两条路径所得复合相同"}, {"source_term": "fibre product", "target_term": "纤维积", "context": "指待证的拉回性质"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表", "context": "指待证为纤维积的方形图表"}, {"source_term": "horizontal", "target_term": "水平", "context": "修饰方形图表下方箭头"}, {"source_term": "arrow", "target_term": "箭头", "context": "指图表下方的映射"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射", "context": "指图表下方箭头的单射性"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指保证下方箭头单射的各映射"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射", "context": "指各映射的单射性"}, {"source_term": "section", "target_term": "截面", "context": "指用于判断成员关系的截面"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "指底拓扑空间中的点"}, {"source_term": "section", "target_term": "截面", "context": "指逐点局部来自另一截面的截面"}, {"source_term": "section", "target_term": "截面", "context": "指在每点附近给出所考察截面的截面"}, {"source_term": "stalk", "target_term": "茎", "context": "修饰取各点处茎的函子"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子", "context": "指逐点取茎的函子"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "指局部条件与逐点条件逻辑等价"}, {"source_term": "stalk", "target_term": "茎", "context": "指考察截面取值的茎"}, {"source_term": "stalk", "target_term": "茎", "context": "指提供该值的元素所在的茎"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素", "context": "指来源茎中的元素"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0085:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为拓扑空间（topological space）。\n设<MATH_0002>为<MATH_0003>上的阿贝尔（abelian）预层（presheaf）。\n则<MATH_0004>上存在唯一的阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）结构，使得<MATH_0005>是阿贝尔（abelian）预层（presheaves）之间的态射（morphism）。此外，下列伴随性质（adjointness property）成立：\n<MATH_0006>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "abelian", "target_term": "阿贝尔"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "abelian sheaf", "target_term": "阿贝尔层"}, {"source_term": "abelian", "target_term": "阿贝尔"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "adjointness property", "target_term": "伴随性质"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "指阿贝尔预层的底空间"}, {"source_term": "abelian", "target_term": "阿贝尔", "context": "修饰给定的预层"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "指给定的阿贝尔群值预层"}, {"source_term": "abelian sheaf", "target_term": "阿贝尔层", "context": "指所赋予的层结构"}, {"source_term": "abelian", "target_term": "阿贝尔", "context": "修饰所述态射的两端对象"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层", "context": "指所述态射的定义域和陪域"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指保持阿贝尔预层结构的映射"}, {"source_term": "adjointness property", "target_term": "伴随性质", "context": "指公式所表达的伴随关系"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0085:proof", "translation": "回顾集合（sets）层（sheaf）<MATH_0001>，它定义于第<REF_0001>节。所有茎（stalks）<MATH_0002>都是阿贝尔群（abelian groups），见引理<REF_0002>。\n因此<MATH_0003>是阿贝尔群（abelian groups）层（sheaf），见例<REF_0003>。\n此外，映射（map）<MATH_0004>显然是阿贝尔（abelian）预层（presheaves）之间的态射（morphism）。若能证明条件<MATH_0005>（见第<REF_0004>节）定义了<MATH_0006>的一个子群（subgroup），且对所有开子集（open subsets）<MATH_0007>都如此，则<MATH_0008>以典范方式（canonically）继承阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）的结构。直接证明这一点相当容易，我们留给读者找一个简单而妥当的论证。我们这里用的论证可推广到代数结构（algebraic structures）预层（presheaves），具体如下：引理<REF_0005>表明，<MATH_0009>是一个阿贝尔群（abelian groups）图表（diagram）的纤维积（fibre product）。因此<MATH_0010>是阿贝尔（abelian）子群（subgroup），正如所求。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n注意，此时<MATH_0011>是阿贝尔群（abelian group）（见引理<REF_0006>），而<MATH_0012>既是双射（bijection）（引理<REF_0007>），又是阿贝尔群（abelian groups）之间的同态（homomorphism）。因此<MATH_0013>是阿贝尔群（abelian groups）之间的同构（isomorphism）。下文使用这一事实时不再另行说明。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n为证明这一伴随性质（adjointness property），我们利用集合预层（presheaves of sets）的层化（sheafification）所具有的伴随性质（adjointness property）。例如，若<MATH_0014>是预层（presheaves）之间的态射（morphism），则得到层（sheaves）之间的态射（morphism）<MATH_0015>。我们需要验证它是阿贝尔层（abelian sheaves）之间的态射（morphism）。例如，可以根据引理<REF_0008>看出这一点在各茎（stalks）上成立，再使用上面的引理<REF_0009>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "stalks", "target_term": "茎"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "abelian", "target_term": "阿贝尔"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "subgroup", "target_term": "子群"}, {"source_term": "open subsets", "target_term": "开子集"}, {"source_term": "canonically", "target_term": "典范方式"}, {"source_term": "abelian sheaf", "target_term": "阿贝尔层"}, {"source_term": "algebraic structures", "target_term": "代数结构"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "fibre product", "target_term": "纤维积"}, {"source_term": "abelian", "target_term": "阿贝尔"}, {"source_term": "subgroup", "target_term": "子群"}, {"source_term": "abelian group", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "bijection", "target_term": "双射"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "adjointness property", "target_term": "伴随性质"}, {"source_term": "presheaves of sets", "target_term": "集合预层"}, {"source_term": "sheafification", "target_term": "层化"}, {"source_term": "adjointness property", "target_term": "伴随性质"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "abelian sheaves", "target_term": "阿贝尔层"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "stalks", "target_term": "茎"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指层的取值类型"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "指前文定义的集合值层"}, {"source_term": "stalks", "target_term": "茎", "context": "指该层在各点处的茎"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群", "context": "指各茎的群结构"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群", "context": "指所得层的取值类型"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "指例子所给出的层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指随后认作态射的映射"}, {"source_term": "abelian", "target_term": "阿贝尔", "context": "修饰态射两端的预层"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层", "context": "指态射所连接的对象"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指保持预层中阿贝尔群结构的映射"}, {"source_term": "subgroup", "target_term": "子群", "context": "指由给定条件定义的子群"}, {"source_term": "open subsets", "target_term": "开子集", "context": "指条件必须适用的所有开子集"}, {"source_term": "canonically", "target_term": "典范方式", "context": "说明层结构继承的方式"}, {"source_term": "abelian sheaf", "target_term": "阿贝尔层", "context": "指所继承的结构"}, {"source_term": "algebraic structures", "target_term": "代数结构", "context": "指推广时预层的取值类型"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层", "context": "指该论证所推广至的对象"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群", "context": "指图表各对象的类型"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表", "context": "指用于计算纤维积的图表"}, {"source_term": "fibre product", "target_term": "纤维积", "context": "指由引用引理给出的构造"}, {"source_term": "abelian", "target_term": "阿贝尔", "context": "修饰所得的子群"}, {"source_term": "subgroup", "target_term": "子群", "context": "指所得并满足要求的子群"}, {"source_term": "abelian group", "target_term": "阿贝尔群", "context": "指引用引理给出其群结构的对象"}, {"source_term": "bijection", "target_term": "双射", "context": "指同一映射所具备的集合论性质"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群", "context": "指该同态两端的对象"}, {"source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态", "context": "指保持群结构的映射"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群", "context": "指该同构两端的对象"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "指作为双射且保持群结构的映射"}, {"source_term": "adjointness property", "target_term": "伴随性质", "context": "指此处要证明的性质"}, {"source_term": "presheaves of sets", "target_term": "集合预层", "context": "指作为层化输入的集合值预层"}, {"source_term": "sheafification", "target_term": "层化", "context": "指用来证明伴随性质的构造"}, {"source_term": "adjointness property", "target_term": "伴随性质", "context": "指集合预层层化已有的性质"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层", "context": "指例子中的输入态射两端的对象"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指例子中的输入态射"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "指所得态射两端的对象"}, {"source_t