{"unit_id": "tag:0087:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为拓扑空间（topological space）。\n设<MATH_0002>为一种代数结构（algebraic structure）类型。\n设<MATH_0003>为取值于<MATH_0004>的、定义在<MATH_0005>上的预层（presheaf）。则存在层（sheaf）<MATH_0006>，取值于<MATH_0007>，以及态射（morphism）<MATH_0008>，其两端为取值于<MATH_0009>的预层（presheaves）。它们具有以下性质：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 映射（map）<MATH_0010>将<MATH_0011>的底层（underlying）集合（sets）层（sheaf）与<MATH_0012>的底层（underlying）集合（sets）预层（presheaf）的层化（sheafification）等同起来。\n<STRUCT_0003> 对任意态射（morphism）<MATH_0013>，其中<MATH_0014>是取值于<MATH_0015>的层（sheaf），存在唯一的分解（factorization）<MATH_0016>。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "algebraic structure", "target_term": "代数结构"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "underlying", "target_term": "底层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "underlying", "target_term": "底层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sheafification", "target_term": "层化"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "factorization", "target_term": "分解"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "指预层所定义的底空间"}, {"source_term": "algebraic structure", "target_term": "代数结构", "context": "指指定其类型的结构"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "指要施行层化的对象"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "指存在性部分给出的对象"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指存在性部分给出的预层间映射"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层", "context": "指所给态射两端的对象"},