{"unit_id": "tag:0089:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为拓扑空间（topological space）。\n设<MATH_0002>为<MATH_0003>上的环（rings）预层（presheaf）。\n设<MATH_0004>为<MATH_0005>-模（modules）预层（presheaf）。\n设<MATH_0006>为<MATH_0007>的层化（sheafification）。\n设<MATH_0008>为<MATH_0009>作为阿贝尔群（abelian groups）预层（presheaf）的层化（sheafification）。存在集合（sets）层（sheaves）之间的映射（map）\n<MATH_0010>，\n使图表（diagram）\n<MATH_0011>\n交换（commute），并使<MATH_0012>成为<MATH_0013>-模（modules）层（sheaf）。此外，若<MATH_0014>是<MATH_0015>-模（modules）层（sheaf），则<MATH_0016>-模（modules）预层（presheaves）的任意态射（morphism）<MATH_0017>（其目标是将<MATH_0018>限制（restriction）为<MATH_0019>-模（module）所得的对象）都唯一地分解（factors）为<MATH_0020>，其中<MATH_0021>是<MATH_0022>-模（modules）之间的态射（morphism）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sheafification", "target_term": "层化"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sheafification", "target_term": "层化"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "commute", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "factors", "target_term": "分解"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_te