{"unit_id": "tag:0088:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n实际上，这意味着函子（functor）\n<MATH_0001>\n（结合限制（restriction）与把层（sheaves）嵌入（including）预层（presheaves））和引理中的层化（sheafification）函子（functor）\n<MATH_0002>\n互为伴随（adjoint）。用公式表示为\n<MATH_0003>\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n设<MATH_0004>为拓扑空间（topological space）。\n设<MATH_0005>为<MATH_0006>上的环层（sheaves of rings）之间的态射（morphism）。\n在第<REF_0001>节中，我们针对这一情形定义了模（modules）预层（presheaves）上的限制（restriction）函子（functor）和环（rings）的变换（change）函子（functor）。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n若<MATH_0007>是<MATH_0008>-模（modules）层（sheaf），则<MATH_0009>作为<MATH_0010>的限制（restriction），显然是<MATH_0011>-模（modules）层（sheaf）。由此得到限制（restriction）函子（functor）\n<MATH_0012>\n\n<STRUCT_0006><STRUCT_0007>\n另一方面，给定一个<MATH_0013>-模（modules）层（sheaf）<MATH_0014>，<MATH_0015>-模（modules）预层（presheaf）\n<MATH_0016>\n一般并非层（sheaf）。因此，我们用公式定义<TEXTITOPEN_0001>张量积层（tensor product sheaf）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>\n<MATH_0017>：\n<MATH_0018>\n即对我们在预层（presheaves）上的构造作层化（sheafification）。由此得到<TEXTITOPEN_0002>环（rings）的变换（change）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>函子（functor）\n<MATH_0019>\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "including", "target_term": "嵌入"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sheafification", "target_term": "层化"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "adjoint", "target_term": "伴随"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "sheaves of rings", "target_term": "环层"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "change", "target_term": "变换"}, {"source_term": "functo